{"baseRefName":"main","body":"SC-02 adds 30 original modeled assets across six families, real lights, mist, particles, surface projections, synthesized spatial audio and presentation phenomena to Spatial Studio. Creators edit ordinary constituent entities, save/reuse compositions through the canonical Scene Library, and retain authored behavior after save/reload. The package includes embedded original textures, meter-scale metadata, articulation pivots, bounded budgets and provenance. Current Player/native adapters preserve the new elements through Guided alternatives.\n\nSC-02's complete head `73db990b554e2236df7bbda4286f5b8023a3636f` is already an ancestor of combined Spatial Studio [PR #722](https://github.com/Kgray44/treasurehuntSoT/pull/722), candidate `325a0c5d2f37ee975d16527960048815ee8edcf9`. Direct Git verification on 2026-10-16 identifies no separate SC-02 product delta to merge independently. The integration owner retains later placement, rendered-width, saved-scale and root-animation repairs; the original shared UI must stay superseded by that combined source.\n\nFresh verification in an independent D: Git repository, with no alternate object store, passes 169 foundation tests across the element package, full-volume placement planner and environment-aware insertion adapter at exact combined candidate `325a0c5d`. The 30-GLB tree, manifest, catalog, model/surface recipes and element schema match SC-02's recorded head. Hash verification passes for 282 retained files, including all 30 GLBs totaling 16,014,844 bytes. Documentation and Feature Catalog checks pass, with no completed-feature promotion. These checks establish source containment and bounded software behavior; combined rendered acceptance remains pending.\n\nHistorical evidence under `Development_Docs/Projects/Project_Parallax/evidence/sc02/owner-continuation-01` remains unchanged: asset review ordinal five resolves the vase finish at supplied exported/Studio views; eight production-browser journeys pass at `5fa77366665b160f79065012a606b97cf2fe3f23`; independent local re-review resolves the mobile overlap. All failures and cumulative review transitions remain recorded. The count audit qualifies the earlier prospective iteration-limit claim and preserves the unchanged trusted validator; it grants no reset, lower count or exception.\n\nThis PR remains draft while [Crossdeck #721](https://github.com/Kgray44/treasurehuntSoT/pull/721) completes its base-sensitive protected work. The #722 owner then owns current-main reconciliation, combined real-browser proof, independent review, ordinary Sounding Line acceptance and protected integration. SC-02 closure requires verifying landed source containment and any true residual delta after that accepted cohort merge. No duplicate merge of older shared source, trusted preparation, Mainline Decision, physical/native readiness or owner acceptance is claimed here.\n","commits":[{"authoredDate":"2026-10-15T03:47:37Z","authors":[{"email":"kkidsgray@icloud.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0MzczMDEx","login":"Kgray44","name":"Kgray44"}],"committedDate":"2026-10-15T03:47:37Z","messageBody":"","messageHeadline":"feat(parallax): prepare SC-02 assets and spatial effects candidate","oid":"975016c887416a14e1a1d817c4fcc90f90165aee"},{"authoredDate":"2026-10-15T03:54:02Z","authors":[{"email":"kkidsgray@icloud.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0MzczMDEx","login":"Kgray44","name":"Kgray44"}],"committedDate":"2026-10-15T03:54:02Z","messageBody":"… blocker","messageHeadline":"fix(parallax): preserve scene metadata and expose asset qualification…","oid":"3be8a828c60317dd078f6451435e2ef686843af6"},{"authoredDate":"2026-10-15T04:07:18Z","authors":[{"email":"kkidsgray@icloud.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0MzczMDEx","login":"Kgray44","name":"Kgray44"}],"committedDate":"2026-10-15T04:07:18Z","messageBody":"…rols","messageHeadline":"fix(parallax): stage supported showcases and clear narrow canvas cont…","oid":"0ccce05713c41a580a25cceddced8611684799cd"},{"authoredDate":"2026-10-15